Additional Commercial Attribution Condition

If the Software, or a derivative work of the Software, is used in a commercial
product or service that exceeds either of the following thresholds during a
calendar month:

1. 1,000 monthly active users; or
2. USD 10,000 in gross monthly revenue, or the equivalent in another currency,

the operator of that product or service must prominently display
"www.superii.site" in its user interface while either threshold continues to
be exceeded. For a web product, the displayed text must be a working link to
https://www.superii.site. For a product without links, clearly readable text is
sufficient.

"Monthly active user" means a distinct person or organization that actively
uses the product or service during the calendar month. "Gross monthly revenue"
means revenue attributable to that product or service before deductions,
refunds, fees, or expenses.

